[{"id":178574179,"discussion_id":"7bfec44033ae65216cf85dea030a94377a4f5fbe","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| attention | ✅ [*於欣洁*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62), [*yuhao_*](https://gitcode.com/yuhao_) (2/2) | ✅ [*於欣洁*](https://gitcode.com/yu-xinjie62) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n xuanyuandy, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:46:27+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T17:43:53+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178574452,"discussion_id":"aac946ace10ec479a07a1783b833b5bc905f9438","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `SLIKLLossVectorService::VectorSy` 函数中 split-k 场景下最后一个分块越界的问题。当 `gSizeQueryIndex` 不能被 `nSplitSize` 整除时，原先代码在所有迭代轮次中均使用固定的 `nSplitSize`，导致最后一轮循环访问超出有效数据范围的内存。修复方案引入 `curNSize` 变量，在每轮迭代中动态计算实际应处理的元素数量，确保 `DataCopyExtParams`、内层循环边界以及 `ReduceSum` 的 shape 参数均使用正确的当前块大小。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **引入 `curNSize` 变量**：在每轮循环开头新增 `int64_t curNSize = Min(nSplitSize, static_cast<int64_t>(constInfo.gSizeQueryIndex) - n * nSplitSize);`，计算当前迭代实际需要处理的元素数，解决末尾分块不足 `nSplitSize` 时的越界问题。\n- **修正 `DataCopyExtParams` 的行数参数**：将 `copyBmm2Params` 构造时的第一个参数从固定的 `static_cast<uint16_t>(nSplitSize)` 改为 `static_cast<uint16_t>(curNSize)`，确保数据拷贝范围与实际块大小一致。\n- **修正内层权重处理循环边界**：将 `for (int32_t i = 0; i < nSplitSize; i++)` 改为 `for (int32_t i = 0; i < curNSize; i++)`，避免对超出有效范围的 `weightUb` 元素进行读取和运算。\n- **修正 `ReduceSum` 的 shape 参数**：将 `reduceShape` 数组的第一个维度从 `static_cast<uint32_t>(nSplitSize)` 改为 `static_cast<uint32_t>(curNSize)`，使归约操作的输入形状与实际数据量匹配。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:47:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T16:47:50+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178575886,"discussion_id":"93dbbde5279ea4b65fd29e07c676709bdce71dca","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:55:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T16:55:35+08:00","user":{"id":"6822c187053cff786c91063e","login":"xuanyuandy","object_id":"6822c187053cff786c91063e","name":"xuanyuandy","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xuanyuandy"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178576344,"discussion_id":"04a9e2481c8b9069b3be7faac9c60d578186d2c0","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=f24a61036c114b579dacc468dcfbfd0f&projectName=CANN'>f24a61036c114b579dacc468dcfbfd0f</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></t